    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command nature itself to defend you from being abducted by the Robot horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/b249ae1fed8f38b1c34d9bc34ab3f4b4.poster.avif?t=1745328326\" width=738 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/b249ae1fed8f38b1c34d9bc34ab3f4b4.webm?t=1745328326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/b249ae1fed8f38b1c34d9bc34ab3f4b4.mp4?t=1745328326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, Upgrade, and then Move your Towers in this unique twist on the Tower Defence genre. With Rogue-Lite mechanics every run offers new strategies, and every death unlocks new upgrades. Grow. Evolve. Destroy the Robots! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/230afa88ffcf18c301b664f1295e9402.poster.avif?t=1745328326\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/230afa88ffcf18c301b664f1295e9402.webm?t=1745328326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/230afa88ffcf18c301b664f1295e9402.mp4?t=1745328326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutate Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful upgrades and build devastating synergies as you play. Create your strategy and adapt to the Mutations you find. But when you die, the mutations are all gone. Build a new strategy for each life and master the synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve new Towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every death the Flora Hive adapts and evolves new strengths. Gather Evolution Points as you play and spend them on the Evolution Tree to gain permanent upgrades and unlock new Towers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command nature itself to defend you from being abducted by the Robot horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/b249ae1fed8f38b1c34d9bc34ab3f4b4.poster.avif?t=1745328326\" width=738 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/b249ae1fed8f38b1c34d9bc34ab3f4b4.webm?t=1745328326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/b249ae1fed8f38b1c34d9bc34ab3f4b4.mp4?t=1745328326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, Upgrade, and then Move your Towers in this unique twist on the Tower Defence genre. With Rogue-Lite mechanics every run offers new strategies, and every death unlocks new upgrades. Grow. Evolve. Destroy the Robots! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/230afa88ffcf18c301b664f1295e9402.poster.avif?t=1745328326\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/230afa88ffcf18c301b664f1295e9402.webm?t=1745328326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413850/extras/230afa88ffcf18c301b664f1295e9402.mp4?t=1745328326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutate Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful upgrades and build devastating synergies as you play. Create your strategy and adapt to the Mutations you find. But when you die, the mutations are all gone. Build a new strategy for each life and master the synergies.</p><h2 class=\"